Package: anaR
Title: Acute Needs Analysis Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("gnoblet", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "gnoblet@zaclys.net")
Description: Validates, flags, and exports ANA humanitarian data. Ports the
    core pipeline of the ANA SvelteKit dashboard to R: CSV validation against
    a reference metric framework, threshold-based flagging with rollup from
    metric to system level, and Excel deep-dive export.
